            <rule id="3abb-ec95-491d-9cef" name="Army General (+35 pts, +1 Wound)" hidden="false">
              <description>One Commander may be upgraded to Army General (+35 pts, +1 Wound); one other Commander may be upgraded to Army Standard Bearer (+15 pts), who may not upgrade equipment except for a warhorse and partial plate armour.</description>
