              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, and either thrusting spear and shield, or light crossbow. Rides a horse. May have light armour (+2 pts). Later Army: may exchange crossbow for handgun (+2 pts). Open Order. 0-2 Diener units (Mercenary and Militia together). (Armies of Chivalry p.41)</characteristic>
