            <rule id="09c5-aaff-ac76-12de" name="Verlorene Haufe (Skirmishers; +1 pt per model)" hidden="false">
              <description>Later Imperial Armies: mercenaries that fight on foot count as Landsknecht (+1 pt per model up to 20 pts per unit); for every unit of Landsknecht Pikemen, a unit of eight Landsknecht Halberdier or Handgunner models may be upgraded to Verlorene Haufe (+1 pt per model).</description>
            </rule>
